	//First Event 1/5 Hearts
"Sophia.IntroEvent.01": "Sophia doesn't seem to be noticing you.",
"Sophia.IntroEvent.02": "Gently tap her in the shoulder.",
"Sophia.IntroEvent.03": "Give her a scare!",
"Sophia.IntroEvent.04": "!!!$5",
"Sophia.IntroEvent.05": "O-oh. @?$2#$b#It's just you?$0",
"Sophia.IntroEvent.06": "O-oh. @?$2#$b#It's just you?$0#$b#Jeez, you didn't have to scare me like that.$2",
"Sophia.IntroEvent.07": "S-sorry if I didn't notice you. I was just umm thinking about something.$2",
"Sophia.IntroEvent.08": "So um. Hey. You're kinda new to farming so...$0",
"Sophia.IntroEvent.09": "Um. I want to give you a device as my way of welcoming you to the valley.$1#$b#Follow me to my storage chest!$1",
"Sophia.IntroEvent.10": "Here! It's a sprinkler![621]$1#$b#It'll automatically water adjacent crops every day.$9",
"Sophia.IntroEvent.11": "You received a 'Quality Sprinkler'!",
"Sophia.IntroEvent.12": "I have an order ledger in my crafts room.$0#$b#If you need more, you can purchase sprinklers from me.$1#$b#But they won't come cheap haha.$9",
"Sophia.IntroEvent.13": "Oh. Um. Hello!$1#$b#How's the sprinkler? Does it still work?$0",
	
	
	
	//Second Event 2 Hearts
"Sophia.2hearts.01": "Hey, you seem a bit out of it. Is everything okay, boo?$2",
"Sophia.2hearts.02": "Oh, sorry. I'm just trailing off in thought...$2",
"Sophia.2hearts.03": "You said the doctor prescribed you new medicine?$0#$b#Is it helping with...?$2",
"Sophia.2hearts.04": "Yeah. I guess it helps...$2",
"Sophia.2hearts.05": "Hey! You'll get through this. I'll visit you a hundred times if that's what it takes!$1",
"Sophia.2hearts.06": "...$2#$b#...$0#$b#...$1",
"Sophia.2hearts.07": "You always know how to cheer me up.$1",
"Sophia.2hearts.08": "Who's that over there?$0",
"Sophia.2hearts.09": "Oh, um. That's @, the new farmer I told you about.$1",
"Sophia.2hearts.10": "Nice to meet you, @! I'm Scarlett, a friend of this dork.$1#$b#Gettin' into the farming business? It's tough work.$0#$b#I live in Grampleton with my papa. He's over at Marnie's with the truck loading up a bunch of milk and wool.$1",
"Sophia.2hearts.11": "We met during a meetup. Grampleton is kinda far away, so it's sorta special when she visits.$1",
"Sophia.2hearts.12": "Shoot. I should run back. He's probably just about done by now.$2",
"Sophia.2hearts.13": "Aww, okay.$2#$b#Text me later?$1",
"Sophia.2hearts.14": "For sure! I'll send you something funny!$1",
"Sophia.2hearts.15": "It was nice meeting you, @.$0",
"Sophia.2hearts.16": "Bye, boo.$1",
"Sophia.2hearts.17": "Bye, you!$1",
"Sophia.2hearts.18": "Hey...$2",
"Sophia.2hearts.19": "Did you hear anything we were talking about?...$2",
"Sophia.2hearts.19B": "#No. I heard nothing.#Something about medicine?",
"Sophia.2hearts.20": "...$2#$b#If you did, please keep it to yourself.$2",
"Sophia.2hearts.21": "H-hey. About earlier... I just... *sigh*.$2#$e#Um. So you met Scarlett. She doesn't visit often, we usually call each other or text.$0",
"Sophia.2hearts.Medicine.01": "You shouldn't be eavesdropping on people like that, it's rude.$2#$b#Please don't talk to anyone about it, keep it to yourself.$2",
"Sophia.2hearts.Medicine.02": "H-hey I'm sorry about earlier... I just... *sigh*.$2#$e#Um. So you met Scarlett. She doesn't visit often, we usually call each other or text.$0",
	
	
	
	//3rd Event 4 Hearts
"Sophia.4hearts.01": "O-oh! Um. Hi, @.$2",
"Sophia.4hearts.02": "#Hey! How are you doing?#Tell me why you were in the hospital!",
"Sophia.4hearts.03": "I don't owe you an explanation. Leave me alone.$3#$e#Stop it!$6#$e#...$12#$e#%Sophia is crying.",
"Sophia.4hearts.HowAreYou.01": "Um...$2#$b#...$6#$b#I-I've been better. W-why are you asking?$6",
"Sophia.4hearts.HowAreYou.02": "I should do something to cheer up Sophia...",
"Sophia.4hearts.HowAreYou.03": "#Want to pet Dusty with me?#Are you hungry? We can get food at the saloon.",
"Sophia.4hearts.HowAreYou.04": "F-food? Um...$6",
"Sophia.4hearts.HowAreYou.05": "I-I am a little... hungry.$2#$b#Um. Yeah. I can go for a bite.$1",
"Sophia.4hearts.HowAreYou.06": "Hey ummmm.$2",
"Sophia.4hearts.HowAreYou.07": "This might sound funny but I want to thank you for scaring me that day.$1#$b#Sometimes when I'm alone my thoughts tend to drift away...$2#$b#And they always come back to the same bad memories. And I just feel paralized from the burden of it all.$2#$b#But thankfully, you snapped me out of it.$1#$b#Even if it wasn't your intention I still want to thank you, you really helped me out.$1",
"Sophia.4hearts.HowAreYou.08": "Hey Sophia! I haven't seen you come here with a friend for a while.$0#$b#What would you like to order today? The usual?$1",
"Sophia.4hearts.HowAreYou.09": "Yep! Grampleton orange chicken please!$9",
"Sophia.4hearts.HowAreYou.10": "Of course, Sophia! Anything for a close family friend!$1#$b#I'll try something new with this dish! I know you will enjoy it.$0",
"Sophia.4hearts.HowAreYou.11": "*whisper* Food is on the house, @.$0",
"Sophia.4hearts.HowAreYou.12": "Sophia gobbled up her food quickly! We both left the saloon with full stomachs and laughter.",
"Sophia.4hearts.HowAreYou.13": "Hey, @. Thanks for inviting me out for food.$2#$b#Um. It really helped.$1#$e#Hey, I'll see your around, okay?$9",

"Sophia.4hearts.Dusty.01": "D-Dusty? Um...$2",
"Sophia.4hearts.Dusty.02": "I'd like that.$2#$b#Sure. Let's go.$1",
"Sophia.4hearts.Dusty.03": "!!!$1",
"Sophia.4hearts.Dusty.04": "Oh my gosh! Aren't you just so so so adorable!?$9",
"Sophia.4hearts.Dusty.05": "Hey ummmm.$2",
"Sophia.4hearts.Dusty.06": "This might sound funny but I want to thank you for scaring me that day.$1#$b#Sometimes when I'm alone my thoughts tend to drift away...$2#$b#They always tend to drift towards bad memories and I just feel paralized from the burden of it all.$2#$b#But thankfully, you snapped me out of it.$1#$b#Even if it wasn't your intention I still want to thank you, you really helped me out.$1",
"Sophia.4hearts.Dusty.07": "Now, how about we give Dusty a few more pets.$9",
"Sophia.4hearts.Dusty.08": "!!!$4",
"Sophia.4hearts.Dusty.09": "We gave Dusty many pets. Sophia laughed a lot. She feels better.",
"Sophia.4hearts.Dusty.10": "Dusty is such a good boy.$1#$b#Um. Petting him cheered me up.$9#$e#Thanks, @.$1",



