"Sophia.6hearts2.Wait.07": "Th-this is just something I live with.$10#$b#I-it used to be worse before I started taking medication...$12",
"Sophia.6hearts2.Wait.08": "*sniff*...",
"Sophia.6hearts2.Wait.09": "Um...$6#$b#I-I'm sorry you have to see me like this...$12",
"Sophia.6hearts2.Wait.10": "#I understand this is difficult. I'm here for you.#You'll get over this soon.",
"Sophia.6hearts2.Wait.11": "I think that to myself everyday you know?$10#$b#All the years that I've been like this I have wished that my problems would just dissapear 'soon'.$10#$b#But that's not how life works, things don't just dissapear, my feelings won't go away.$12#$b#You have been nothing but rude this entire time. Please leave.$7",
"Sophia.6hearts2.Wait.12": "Thanks for checking on me, but I don't appreciate what you said.$3#$b#I'm sorry for lashing out at you with my emotions.$2#$e#YBut you really hurt my feelings...$6#$e#%Sophia doesn't want to talk...",

"Sophia.6hearts2.Wait2.01": "Wait!$6",
