"Sophia.6hearts2.Wait2.03": "You were worried about me?...$6",
"Sophia.6hearts2.Wait2.04": "Um...$12",
"Sophia.6hearts2.Wait2.05": "Look...$6#$b#You don't need to worry...$6#$b#Th-this is just um...$12",
"Sophia.6hearts2.Wait2.06": "*sniff*...",
"Sophia.6hearts2.Wait2.07": "This is just something I live with.$10#$b#It used to be worse before I started taking medication...$12",
"Sophia.6hearts2.Wait2.08": "*sniff*...",
"Sophia.6hearts2.Wait2.09": "Um...$6#$b#I-I'm sorry you have to see me like this...$12",
"Sophia.6hearts2.Wait2.10": "#I understand this is difficult. I'm here for you.#You'll get over this soon.",
"Sophia.6hearts2.Wait2.11": "You have been very appreciative this entire time but what you said just now really hurts me.$12#$b#Please leave. I need some time alone...$12",
"Sophia.6hearts2.Wait2.12": "Thanks for checking on me, but I still can't get over what you said.$3#$b#What I have... it isn't something you can just 'get over'...$2#$e#You really hurt my feelings...$6#$e#%Sophia doesn't want to talk...",

"Sophia.6hearts2.HereForYou.01": "Th-thanks...$10",
"Sophia.6hearts2.HereForYou.02": "...$6#$b#Um...$6#$b#Something that helps is spending time with people.$6#$b#I don't have much here to do...$6",
"Sophia.6hearts2.HereForYou.03": "But I do have some anime, do you want to watch it together?$6",
"Sophia.6hearts2.HereForYou.04": "#Sure. Let's watch it.#I don't like watching TV.",
"Sophia.6hearts2.HereForYou.05": "O-oh. okay...$6",
"Sophia.6hearts2.HereForYou.06": "I'm going to go to my room.$6#$b#Th-thanks for umm checking on me, @.$10",
"Sophia.6hearts2.HereForYou.07": "Hey. I'm not normally like that so don't get the wrong idea about me.$6#$e#I-I need some time to myself...$6#$e#%Sophia doesn't want to talk anymore.",

"Sophia.6hearts2.HereForYou2.01": "Thanks...$10",
"Sophia.6hearts2.HereForYou2.02": "...$6#$b#Um...$6#$b#Something that helps is spending time with people.$6#$b#I don't have much here to do...$6",
"Sophia.6hearts2.HereForYou2.03": "But I do have some anime, do you want to watch it together?$6",
"Sophia.6hearts2.HereForYou2.04": "#Sure. Let's watch it.#I don't like watching TV.",
"Sophia.6hearts2.HereForYou2.05": "O-oh that's okay. Watching anime isn't for everyone I understand why you wouldn't want to watch it.$6",
"Sophia.6hearts2.HereForYou2.06": "I'm going to go to my room.$6#$b#Th-thanks for checking on me, @.$10#$b#Even if it's not that much, I still feel a bit better.$10",
"Sophia.6hearts2.HereForYou2.07": "Hey. I'm not normally like that so don't get the wrong idea about me.$6#$e#I-I need some time to myself...$6#$e#%Sophia doesn't want to talk anymore.",

"Sophia.6hearts2.WatchAnime.01": "That makes me... happy.$10#$b#It was really scary when you abruptly opened the door on me crying.$12#$b#I was almost going to lash out at you, it's been so long sinCE someone has cared much about my situation that isn't Scarlett.$12#$b#Gus has been very kind through all of this but it almost feels like he has forgotten..$12",
"Sophia.6hearts2.WatchAnime.02": "Sorry I'm really getting off topic here.$12#$b#Get settled on the couch. I'll go and try to clean myself up a bit, I don't want to watch it like this.$10",
"Sophia.6hearts2.WatchAnime.03": "Sophia and I watched an anime called 'Pink Princess Crusaders'. Her mood improved but it still feels like there is something disturbing her...",
"Sophia.6hearts2.WatchAnime.04": "Thanks for checking on me and everything...$2#$b#Um. Did you like watching 'Pink Princess Crusaders'?$1#$e#I know right? It's such a silly show, but it makes me happy.$9#$b#They're working on a second season!$1",

"Sophia.6hearts2.WatchAnime2.01": "That makes me... happy.$10#$b#I'm sorry that I've kept you in the dark for so long even though you've been so nice.$12#$b#I need some time before I can open up but know that one day, I will tell you all about it.$10",
"Sophia.6hearts2.WatchAnime2.02": "Get settled on the couch. I'll go and try to clean myself up a bit, I don't want to watch it like this.$10",
"Sophia.6hearts2.WatchAnime2.03": "Sophia and I watched an anime called 'Pink Princess Crusaders'. Her mood improved but it still feels like there is something disturbing her...",
"Sophia.6hearts2.WatchAnime2.04": "Thanks for checking on me and everything...$2#$b#Um. Did you like watching 'Pink Princess Crusaders'?$1#$e#I know right? It's such a silly show, but it makes me happy.$9#$b#They're working on a second season!$1",



    //5th Event 7 Hearts
"Sophia.7hearts1.01": "Hey, you!$9#$b#I'm checking these casks. This column here has been aging for many years now!$1",
"Sophia.7hearts1.02": "This is one of the last casks of wine from my mom and dad, it's been sitting here for a while...$0",
"Sophia.7hearts1.03": "O-oh. It's okay.$0#$b#Please don't feel bad.$2",
"Sophia.7hearts1.04": "Um...$2",
"Sophia.7hearts1.05": "Hey. Let's head upstairs.$0#$b#I...$2#$b#I... want to tell you a little about my parents.$1",
"Sophia.7hearts1.06": "Um...$2#$b#Th-this was the room you found me in last time...$2#$b#It's my parents room or what's left of it at least...$2#$b#Come inside.$0",
"Sophia.7hearts1.07": "It's been like this for ages now... ever since....$2",
"Sophia.7hearts1.08": "Um. Th-they...$2#$b#My mom and dad...$2",
"Sophia.7hearts1.09": "There was a car crash...$2",
"Sophia.7hearts1.10": "It was... the 4th of fall. My parents were on a business trip.$2#$b#They were gone all day and wouldn't answer their phone. It was weird.$2",
"Sophia.7hearts1.11": "That evening, there were knocks on the front door...$2#$b#I was greeted by Mayor Lewis and Gus, with tears in their eyes...$6",
"Sophia.7hearts1.12": "Th-they told me that my mom and dad...$6",
"Sophia.7hearts1.13": "The whole town was in grief about it, their graves were filled with countless flowers in their memory.$6#$b#Lewis, Gus and everyone would come over and help me sort out my feelings.$6#$b#The pain was unbearable but seeing others in the same pain as me, struggling, cherishing their memory.$6#$b#It made me feel just a little bit better.$10#$b#But as time went on, less people came over, no one talked about them anymore, the fresh flowers that were put on their grave lessened everyday...$12#$b#It felt like they were being forgotten and I was the only one who still remembered them...$6",
"Sophia.7hearts1.14": "I don't want to forget them! I wish that they could live on forever.$7#$b#But it hurts, it hurts to remember what you will never have back.$12",
"Sophia.7hearts1.15": "I did once tried to forget them. One night while I was crying something snapped in me.$6#$b#I feverishly tried to pack away as much as I could from their room, trying to stuff their memories away.$12#$b#But all I ended up achieving was giving me regret for trying to forget them.$12#$b#Those precious memories I don't want them to dissapear but they hurt...$7",
"Sophia.7hearts1.16": "And that's how I ended up here, no better since the day they died...$6",
"Sophia.7hearts1.17": "You and Scarlett have helped me so much through this...$10#$b#If it weren't for you guys I would have been in a very bad place.$12",
"Sophia.7hearts1.18": "I still took up managing the vineyard.$2#$b#But it feels... wrong to tarnish the hard work of my parents, Bluemoon wine still isn't as good as it was in the old days.$2",
"Sophia.7hearts1.19": "$q -1 null#(What should I say)#$r -1 0 sophia_event1#You're still doing a great job managing the vineyard.#$r -1 0 sophia_event2#I want to do everything I can to help.",
"Sophia.7hearts1.19.1": "What should I say?",
"Sophia.7hearts1.19.2": "You're still doing a great job managing the vineyard.",
"Sophia.7hearts1.19.3": "I want to do everything I can to help.",
"Sophia.7hearts1.19.4": "I've been told that a lot of times but I know what people say...$2#$b#I just can't compare to them....$2",
"Sophia.7hearts1.19.5": "I'm glad I can have your support. You're a great friend.$9",
"Sophia.7hearts1.20": "Talking with you really helps me out @.$0#$b#It's been so long since I've been able to pour out my thoughts.$1#$b#It also helps me put things in perspective.$0#$b#I don't want to hide away from my feelings, I shouldn't be trying to box up all my memories just because they hurt.$2",
"Sophia.7hearts1.21": "I think I need to organize my parent's room. Maybe that way I can find some sort of closure.$0#$b#This might sound sudden but will you help me organize it? I don't think I can do it myself.$0",
"Sophia.7hearts1.22": "$q -1 null#(What should I say)#$r -1 0 sophia_event3#Sure, I will help you.#$r -1 0 sophia_event4#Will I get something in return?",
"Sophia.7hearts1.22.1": "What should I say?",
"Sophia.7hearts1.22.2": "Sure, I will help you.",
"Sophia.7hearts1.22.3": "Will I get something in return?",
"Sophia.7hearts1.22.4": "Thank you. It means a lot to me that you're willing to go through this.$9",
"Sophia.7hearts1.22.5": "This is very important for me, I hope that you don't see all of this as a game.$0#$b#I want you to have my back as a friend, not as someone I 'hired' to help.$2",
"Sophia.7hearts1.23": "Um. I don't want to push this all on you so suddenly.$1#$b#We'll start organizing stuff tomorrow.$9#$b#Be sure to be well fed there's a lot of boxes we'll have to open and move.$1",
"Sophia.7hearts1.24": "I'm helping Sophia move boxes tomorrow in her house.",
"Sophia.7hearts1.25": "I'm a bit anxious for tommorow but with you we can pull through together.$9",



    //6th Event 7 Hearts Part the Second
"Sophia.7hearts2.01": "Oh, you're here...$0",
"Sophia.7hearts2.02": "I've been mentally preparing myself for this all day, I barely couldn't sleep.$0#$b#Scarlett said she was busy today so it's going to be you and me.$1",
"Sophia.7hearts2.03": "You go on ahead, I'll head inside in a bit.$0",
"Sophia.7hearts2.04": "Sophia gazes at the door, her breathing is unsteady.",
"Sophia.7hearts2.05": "I think I'm ready now. Let's do this.$1",
"Sophia.7hearts2.06": "Sophia and I cleaned and organized her parents' room.",
"Sophia.7hearts2.07": "I think that's everything...$1",
"Sophia.7hearts2.08": "It looks just like how it always has been.$0",
"Sophia.7hearts2.09": "When I look at this room, I remember the nights I spent crying, griefing over my parent's death.$2",
"Sophia.7hearts2.10": "I remember, the day I packed away every memory I had of them inside these boxes to forget.$6#$b#Remembering their death hurts me, it makes me feel horrible.$7",
"Sophia.7hearts2.11": "But funnily enough...$12",
"Sophia.7hearts2.12": "I also remember the days I'd spend with mom trying out new clothes$10#$b#The funny comic books I'd look at with dad or when I tasted wine for the first time.$13",
"Sophia.7hearts2.13": "I-I want to preserve those memories @.$10",
"Sophia.7hearts2.14": "I tried boxing up all my bad memories but I never knew that in the process, all the good ones would be gone as well.$12#$b#This hole will never be filled but... maybe that's alright.$12#$b#If I want to preserve those precious memories, I have to life with the bad ones too.$10#$b#They both define me, I can't pick and choose which ones I like.$10",
"Sophia.7hearts2.15": "Thank you. Everything you've done means a lot to me, I can't stress that enough.$1#$b#I'm going to send you something in the mail, I think it's right that you have it.$9",
"Sophia.7hearts2.16": "Um... Is it okay if I hug you?$2#$e#%You hug Sophia.#$e#!!!$9",
//32

    //7th Event 8 Hearts
"Sophia.8hearts.01": "!!!$9",
