"Sophia.Resolution.DeathDate": "Today's the day my parent's died...$0#$b#Do you want to have a glass of Blue Moon Wine later? I want to reminisce the times I had with them.$1",
"Gus.Happy": "Sophia has been coming by much more recently.$h#$b#I'm really glad she's going out more and making friends, she deserves happiness.$h",
"Scarlett.Happy": "Sophia has been improving a lot recently.$1#$b#She still has some moments but she's working really hard to improve now.$0",


